+/*
+ * ffx_fsr2_api_x64 ABI definitions
+ *
+ * These structures mirror the public FidelityFX SDK ABI:
+ *  - FSR2 "context" convenience API: AMD FidelityFX-FSR2 SDK
+ *    (https://github.com/GPUOpen-Effects/FidelityFX-FSR2),
+ *    src/ffx-fsr2-api/ffx_fsr2.h and ffx_types.h (MIT licensed).
+ *  - ffx_api generic context API and FSR "upscale" effect descriptors:
+ *    AMD FidelityFX SDK (https://github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/FidelityFX-SDK),
+ *    Kits/FidelityFX/api/include/ffx_api*.h and
+ *    Kits/FidelityFX/upscalers/include/ffx_upscale.h (MIT licensed).
+ *
+ * The "external provider" struct (struct ffxExternalProvider) is not public;
+ * its layout was reverse engineered from wine's own dlls/amdxc64
+ * (Copyright 2023 Etaash Mathamsetty, LGPL 2.1+) and cross-checked against a
+ * disassembly of amdxcffx64.dll's UpdateFfxApiProviderEx export.
