+/*
+ * ffx_fsr2_api_x64: translate the AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 2 "context"
+ * API to FidelityFX Super Resolution 4 by driving amdxcffx64.dll's FFX API
+ * "external provider" mechanism directly (the same mechanism wine's
+ * dlls/amdxc64 uses to upgrade FSR 3.1 games to FSR4).
+ *
+ * Games that dynamically load ffx_fsr2_api_x64.dll (frontend) plus
+ * ffx_fsr2_api_dx12_x64.dll / ffx_fsr2_api_vk_x64.dll (backends) can be
+ * redirected to this builtin (WINEDLLOVERRIDES=ffx_fsr2_api_x64=b) to get
+ * FSR4 upscaling quality instead of native FSR2, without any game-side
+ * patching. Only the DX12 path is implemented; the game's own backend dlls
+ * are left untouched (and unused) in this configuration.
+ *
+ * Gated by PROTON_FSR2_UPGRADE=1 (see the `fsr2` compat_config handling in
+ * the `proton` script and protonfixes/upscalers.py).
